    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An anti escape room game where you explore the depths of a mysterious room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The room is deep, how far are you willing to dive in?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2588 \u2581</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You know the rules:-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Only keys can unlock the door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Solve the puzzles, just like the good old days.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. There is no light switch.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique art style : dreamcore x old school Hong Kong</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cantonese dialogue</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
